[en.FOCUS_C09_SEA_POWER]
Sea Power Contention

[en.FOCUS_C09_SEA_POWER_desc]
After getting Applewood, Stellar Flare looked around, only to realize that the expansion on the land seemed to have reached its limit. The ocean, on the other hand, was rarely visited by other ponies or creatures, and this would be the future of Sire’s Hollow. Whoever rules the waves rules the world.

[zh.FOCUS_C09_SEA_POWER]
海权争锋

[zh.FOCUS_C09_SEA_POWER_desc]
在拿下苹果坞后，恒星耀斑环顾四周，才意识到陆地的扩张似乎已经到达了尽头。而海洋如今却鲜有问津，这将是名流谷的未来所在。驾驭波涛者，驾驭世界。

